  "content": "<p>嘿！DR:Reforge 共有 <span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">71種載具</span>，以及 <span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">23項雜項物品</span>，包括 <span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">14套精美的<span>手工製作的軍事制服</span></span>、<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">8種部署武器</span>，還有 <span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">1個用於服務器的載具生成器！</span> 你們還在等什麼？現在就來下載！！！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1346094/description_d52e6466-fc2f-4929-941b-7e9b71eeb885.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1346094/description_dd533f86-91ec-4af9-8204-f427978b42e9.png\" width=\"631\" height=\"344\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1346094/description_d9ffdd17-6ea4-43b3-8d99-a78158680e20.png\" width=\"629\" height=\"291\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">商業/非公益伺服器使用需取得授權</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">本模組任何形式的商業使用均需授權。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"border:0px;font-family:inherit;font-size:14px;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit\">Discord：</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-family:inherit;font-size:14px;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;display:inline;color:#fff\">hellsing_141</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\">ZTZ99B與ZBD04A</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1346094/description_72744752-2160-4543-8a74-a15f63d67bc5.png\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\">AMX56和CV90</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1346094/description_ed128f2d-039e-4897-9892-a09a6aba094c.png\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\">Rafale</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1346094/description_8f1c639f-5b53-4b9a-96fd-4770c2af348a.png\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f